{"availability":"available","full":"Sanjays2402/retrace","name":"retrace","description":"Crash-resumable Python workflows on local SQLite. Durable checkpoints, retries, and a read-only execution inspector. Zero runtime dependencies.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-14T01:48:49Z","updated":"2026-10-04T08:56:58Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://sanjays2402.github.io/retrace/","topics":["asyncio","crash-recovery","dag","data-pipeline","developer-tools","durable-execution","fault-tolerance","observability","python","sqlite","workflow-engine"],"demo":"https://sanjays2402.github.io/retrace/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T11:14:55.102Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T11:14:55.102Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T11:14:55.102Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T06:51:14.166Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-05T05:50:42.130Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-07T11:14:55.102Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The process can stop. The progress stays. Crash-resumable Python workflows. One local SQLite database.","Retrace is an embedded workflow engine for async Python. It checkpoints successful steps, retries transient failures, and resumes interrupted dependency graphs. Run local data pipelines, document ingestion, batch API jobs, or approval workflows with durable progress and an inspectable execution history.","The local inspector shows what completed, what failed, and what needs recovery. Workflow health analytics help you measure reliability; configurable checks turn those measurements into JSON results and exit codes for your own monitoring scripts."],"features":["Preserve completed work. Resume after a worker crash without replaying successful steps.","Handle unreliable dependencies. Persist retry deadlines, classify permanent errors, and","Keep local operations small. Share one SQLite file across worker processes; use durable","Diagnose and measure. Inspect attempts and worker handoffs, export reports and traces,"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sanjays2402/retrace/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"78496279e5da760c6641ba7f48acafe76a9ce554c02471f8222c50d4a038840f","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T05:51:41.690Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T05:51:41.690Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The process can stop. The progress stays. Crash-resumable Python workflows. One local SQLite database.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sanjays2402/retrace/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The public recovery playground needs no account or install.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sanjays2402/retrace/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"78496279e5da760c6641ba7f48acafe76a9ce554c02471f8222c50d4a038840f","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sanjays2402/retrace/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T05:51:41.691Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-04T08:56:58Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sanjays2402/retrace/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T05:51:41.692Z","hash":"78496279e5da760c6641ba7f48acafe76a9ce554c02471f8222c50d4a038840f","originalBytes":15507,"storedBytes":15507,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["retrace","workflow","run","worker","python","assets","docs","local","jobs.db","runs","bash","recovery","retry","work","after","checkpoint","failed","inspector","signal","checkpoints","durable","queue","task","browser","completed","database.","interrupted","see","values","api","attempt","before","data","demo","extract","health","install","one","playground","recovered","report","source","steps","summarize","tests","theme","without","across","check","checks","coverage","crash","dark","definitions","eligible","external","including","light","limits","outputs","reports","resume","return","sqlite","successful","venv","analytics","another","app